sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Reader
  participant RPC as Base RPC (public)
  participant P as ProteanLedger proxy
  participant G as GitHub (this mirror)
  participant L as Local index DB

  Note over R: Step 1 — chain identity
  R->>RPC: eth_call getRecord(recordId)
  RPC->>P: delegatecall
  P-->>R: Record struct + contentDigest

  Note over R: Step 2 — content digest
  R->>RPC: eth_getLogs RecordContentEmitted(recordId)
  RPC-->>R: event payload (envelope plaintext)
  R->>R: keccak256(abi.encode(envelope))
  R->>R: compare to contentDigest
  Note right of R: equal ✓ chain is honest

  Note over R: Step 3 — independent re-index
  R->>G: GET scripts/index_ledger_from_genesis.py
  G-->>R: Python script
  R->>RPC: eth_getLogs (all events from genesis)
  loop for every event
    R->>L: upsert
  end
  R->>R: sha256(canonical_bytes(records sorted, edges sorted))
  R->>R: compare to https://www.protean.sh/ledger published digest
  Note right of R: equal ✓ full state reproduced

  Note over R: Supplemental — replay artifact
  R->>G: GET raw.githubusercontent.com/proteanlabs1/ledger-mirror<br/>@<commit>:artifacts/mainnet/&lt;id&gt;.json
  G-->>R: JSON bytes
  R->>R: shasum -a 256
  R->>R: compare to sha256: suffix in replayPointer
  Note right of R: equal ✓ supplemental artifact not swapped
